WEBVTT

1
00:00:32.875 --> 00:00:35.958
In Chapter 14, Lord Krishna

2
00:00:35.958 --> 00:00:38.083
described the ways a devotee can rise beyond

3
00:00:38.083 --> 00:00:41.875
prakriti’s three gunas.

4
00:00:41.875 --> 00:00:44.291
Now He begins Chapter 15

5
00:00:44.291 --> 00:00:47.958
with a vivid metaphor

6
00:00:47.958 --> 00:00:51.000
that describes the material world.

7
00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:52.708
Rather than simply listing

8
00:00:52.708 --> 00:00:59.833
prakriti’s elements, He uses the image
of a vast Ashwattha tree.

9
00:00:59.833 --> 00:01:03.250
Lord Krishna brings this image to life,

10
00:01:03.250 --> 00:01:04.625
so that Arjun

11
00:01:04.625 --> 00:01:05.583
and we

12
00:01:05.583 --> 00:01:08.583
can see how deeply entangled we
are in this temporary,

13
00:01:08.583 --> 00:01:12.000
illusory world.

14
00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:13.416
As long as we do not

15
00:01:13.416 --> 00:01:17.666
understand this illusion and
the Vedas’ true purpose,

16
00:01:17.666 --> 00:01:19.541
we remain caught.

17
00:01:19.541 --> 00:01:20.625
This verse

18
00:01:20.625 --> 00:01:25.166
lays the foundation for the entire chapter,

19
00:01:25.166 --> 00:01:26.666
where Lord Krishna

20
00:01:26.666 --> 00:01:30.125
will guide us step by step toward liberation

21
00:01:30.125 --> 00:01:36.875
from this illusory tree and reunion
with the eternal Supreme.

22
00:01:41.333 --> 00:01:43.000
Lord Krishna says –

23
00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:46.500
this world is like an Ashwattha tree.

24
00:01:46.500 --> 00:01:48.583
Its roots are above

25
00:01:48.583 --> 00:01:51.250
and its branches spread below.

26
00:01:51.250 --> 00:01:54.083
Its leaves are the hymns of the Vedas.

27
00:01:54.083 --> 00:01:57.583
One who understands the true nature of this tree

28
00:01:57.583 --> 00:02:01.125
knows the real purpose of the Vedas.

29
00:02:01.125 --> 00:02:05.875
But think – roots above and branches below?

30
00:02:05.875 --> 00:02:08.750
This is not describing a real tree.

31
00:02:08.750 --> 00:02:10.958
It is describing its reflection.

32
00:02:10.958 --> 00:02:13.208
Just as the reflection of a tree in water

33
00:02:13.208 --> 00:02:15.125
appears inverted,

34
00:02:15.125 --> 00:02:19.125
this world too is a reflection.

35
00:02:19.125 --> 00:02:20.541
It looks beautiful,

36
00:02:20.541 --> 00:02:23.500
full of variety and experience,

37
00:02:23.500 --> 00:02:27.041
but it is only a shadow – not the real.

38
00:02:27.041 --> 00:02:28.375
The roots of this tree

39
00:02:28.375 --> 00:02:30.708
arise from Brahmaloka –

40
00:02:30.708 --> 00:02:35.333
that is, Brahmaloka is the highest realm

41
00:02:35.333 --> 00:02:36.125
of this material universe,

42
00:02:36.125 --> 00:02:37.583
and below it

43
00:02:37.583 --> 00:02:39.750
the entire cosmos spreads.

44
00:02:39.750 --> 00:02:42.541
Its branches grow downward.

45
00:02:42.541 --> 00:02:44.041
Its leaves are the Vedas –

46
00:02:44.041 --> 00:02:45.041
which show

47
00:02:45.041 --> 00:02:48.416
the means of enjoyment, liberation
and progress.

48
00:02:48.416 --> 00:02:51.208
But the true purpose of the Vedas

49
00:02:51.208 --> 00:02:53.875
is to free us from the grip of this tree

50
00:02:53.875 --> 00:02:56.333
and lead us to the eternal truth.

51
00:02:56.333 --> 00:02:57.791
This is why Lord Krishna

52
00:02:57.791 --> 00:03:01.833
cautions us – if we keep chasing
the tree’s fruits –

53
00:03:01.833 --> 00:03:02.875
pleasure,

54
00:03:02.875 --> 00:03:05.958
success, and power –

55
00:03:05.958 --> 00:03:08.833
we will remain caught in this illusion.

56
00:03:08.833 --> 00:03:10.666
The real purpose of the Vedas

57
00:03:10.666 --> 00:03:12.291
is to cut down this tree

58
00:03:12.291 --> 00:03:14.708
and carry us to the original tree,

59
00:03:14.708 --> 00:03:18.625
where the eternal truth is – where Lord

60
00:03:18.625 --> 00:03:21.125
Krishna Himself dwells.

61
00:03:21.125 --> 00:03:22.791
Thus this verse

62
00:03:22.791 --> 00:03:25.291
sets the direction for the entire chapter –

63
00:03:25.291 --> 00:03:28.291
first understand this confusing tree,

64
00:03:28.291 --> 00:03:32.250
then recognise its impermanence, and finally

65
00:03:32.250 --> 00:03:33.458
move toward that real

66
00:03:33.458 --> 00:03:35.458
eternal truth –

67
00:03:35.458 --> 00:03:38.375
where Lord Krishna is.

68
00:03:42.791 --> 00:03:45.666
Pause and think –

69
00:03:45.666 --> 00:03:47.791
in this world,

70
00:03:47.791 --> 00:03:50.708
much appears attractive –

71
00:03:50.708 --> 00:03:54.791
beautiful, important,

72
00:03:54.791 --> 00:03:58.000
even urgent.

73
00:03:58.000 --> 00:04:01.875
But have you ever stopped to ask –

74
00:04:01.875 --> 00:04:05.333
is all this real,

75
00:04:05.333 --> 00:04:08.708
or merely a reflection?

76
00:04:08.708 --> 00:04:12.250
Like the image of a tree in water –

77
00:04:12.250 --> 00:04:18.000
colourful and clear to see, but
impossible to touch –

78
00:04:18.000 --> 00:04:21.583
life’s experiences

79
00:04:21.583 --> 00:04:24.041
give pleasure for a moment,

80
00:04:24.041 --> 00:04:27.291
then they change.

81
00:04:27.291 --> 00:04:30.250
The more you try to hold them

82
00:04:30.250 --> 00:04:34.583
as permanent,

83
00:04:34.583 --> 00:04:38.083
the more entangled you become.

84
00:04:38.083 --> 00:04:42.708
There is no fault in enjoying life.

85
00:04:42.708 --> 00:04:46.750
But wisdom lies

86
00:04:46.750 --> 00:04:50.958
in learning to look more deeply.

87
00:04:50.958 --> 00:04:53.833
When something

88
00:04:53.833 --> 00:04:58.291
or some experience attracts you,

89
00:04:58.291 --> 00:05:01.291
pause and reflect –

90
00:05:01.291 --> 00:05:04.791
is this connecting you to peace,

91
00:05:04.791 --> 00:05:09.791
to life’s true purpose, and ultimately

92
00:05:09.791 --> 00:05:13.291
to the supreme truth?

93
00:05:13.291 --> 00:05:17.541
You do not need to keep chasing

94
00:05:17.541 --> 00:05:21.416
these mirages.

95
00:05:21.416 --> 00:05:23.458
Your goal is

96
00:05:23.458 --> 00:05:25.958
to reach the source –

97
00:05:25.958 --> 00:05:29.458
which is the root, which is eternal.

98
00:05:29.458 --> 00:05:32.833
With a little

99
00:05:32.833 --> 00:05:36.666
awareness and steady devotion,

100
00:05:36.666 --> 00:05:41.166
I will certainly take you there.

101
00:05:41.166 --> 00:05:42.416
Reflect on this.

102
00:05:46.875 --> 00:05:48.583
In every family, something

103
00:05:48.583 --> 00:05:51.583
is passed forward –

104
00:05:51.583 --> 00:05:54.875
not only wealth or memories,

105
00:05:54.875 --> 00:05:59.000
but also values, habits, and ways of seeing.

106
00:05:59.000 --> 00:06:02.000
The question is –

107
00:06:02.000 --> 00:06:04.583
what are you passing forward?

108
00:06:04.583 --> 00:06:07.458
A life rooted in truth,

109
00:06:07.458 --> 00:06:10.583
or the entanglements of illusion?

110
00:06:10.583 --> 00:06:13.083
This world is

111
00:06:13.083 --> 00:06:16.125
like that reflected tree –

112
00:06:16.125 --> 00:06:20.750
appealing in appearance, but with roots

113
00:06:20.750 --> 00:06:23.333
that are inverted.

114
00:06:23.333 --> 00:06:27.208
If we only hand our children the race for comfort,

115
00:06:27.208 --> 00:06:31.666
praise, and power,

116
00:06:31.666 --> 00:06:34.250
they will keep trying to pluck

117
00:06:34.250 --> 00:06:36.000
the fruits of that shadow –

118
00:06:36.000 --> 00:06:38.666
which will never truly satisfy.

119
00:06:38.666 --> 00:06:39.416
Think –

120
00:06:39.416 --> 00:06:40.958
what kind of path

121
00:06:40.958 --> 00:06:43.958
do you want to show your children?

122
00:06:43.958 --> 00:06:45.666
Only the path of wealth,

123
00:06:45.666 --> 00:06:50.125
or wealth alongside family,
devotion, and service?

124
00:06:50.125 --> 00:06:50.916
Remember –

125
00:06:50.916 --> 00:06:54.541
if all other joys are sacrificed in
the race for wealth alone,

126
00:06:54.541 --> 00:07:00.000
even when wealth comes, true
happiness will not.

127
00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:02.958
Instead, give them

128
00:07:02.958 --> 00:07:06.000
the real inheritance.

129
00:07:06.000 --> 00:07:10.666
Teach them to ask –

130
00:07:10.666 --> 00:07:12.875
‘Is this lasting?

131
00:07:12.875 --> 00:07:17.166
Does this connect me to a higher truth?’

132
00:07:17.166 --> 00:07:20.791
Show them the path of depth, simplicity,

133
00:07:20.791 --> 00:07:23.250
and devotion.

134
00:07:23.250 --> 00:07:27.416
When a family searches for reality together,

135
00:07:27.416 --> 00:07:30.375
they rise together –

136
00:07:30.375 --> 00:07:33.416
out of illusion

137
00:07:33.416 --> 00:07:38.541
and toward lasting joy.

138
00:07:38.541 --> 00:07:40.458
Reflect

139
00:07:40.458 --> 00:07:42.125
on this.

140
00:07:42.125 --> 00:07:45.833
Do not only listen.

141
00:07:50.291 --> 00:07:53.583
You too must have experienced this –

142
00:07:53.583 --> 00:07:58.750
success in this world feels very solid –

143
00:07:58.750 --> 00:08:03.208
position, recognition, awards –

144
00:08:03.208 --> 00:08:08.458
as though these are the true fruits of your effort.

145
00:08:08.458 --> 00:08:10.791
But think –

146
00:08:10.791 --> 00:08:14.708
are you climbing the tree

147
00:08:14.708 --> 00:08:18.125
whose roots are in truth,

148
00:08:18.125 --> 00:08:21.041
or only in its reflection?

149
00:08:21.041 --> 00:08:24.375
On this illusory tree,

150
00:08:24.375 --> 00:08:27.541
achievements are only decoration.

151
00:08:27.541 --> 00:08:32.041
Shining leaves – a pay rise,

152
00:08:32.041 --> 00:08:38.000
a grand office, recognition at work –

153
00:08:38.000 --> 00:08:39.791
but

154
00:08:39.791 --> 00:08:42.750
they do not satisfy the soul.

155
00:08:42.750 --> 00:08:48.458
They only bind you in the craving to be accepted

156
00:08:48.458 --> 00:08:52.500
by everyone,

157
00:08:52.500 --> 00:08:58.125
and pull you into a race that never ends.

158
00:08:58.125 --> 00:09:03.625
I am not asking you to give up responsibility.

159
00:09:03.625 --> 00:09:05.125
Do not think that.

160
00:09:05.125 --> 00:09:08.500
I am only asking –

161
00:09:08.500 --> 00:09:11.791
which tree are you nourishing?

162
00:09:11.791 --> 00:09:15.875
If your ambition arises from clarity

163
00:09:15.875 --> 00:09:19.000
and service, not from

164
00:09:19.000 --> 00:09:22.000
confusion and competition –

165
00:09:22.000 --> 00:09:27.250
then your work truly becomes sacred.

166
00:09:27.250 --> 00:09:31.916
If you are in a leadership role –

167
00:09:31.916 --> 00:09:34.000
your steadiness

168
00:09:34.000 --> 00:09:37.125
gives direction to the entire atmosphere.

169
00:09:37.125 --> 00:09:40.833
And if you are an employee –

170
00:09:40.833 --> 00:09:43.833
your honesty, sincerity,

171
00:09:43.833 --> 00:09:47.833
and contribution are the water for those roots

172
00:09:47.833 --> 00:09:51.291
that give life to the whole workplace.

173
00:09:51.291 --> 00:09:56.083
When you learn to see beyond the surface,

174
00:09:56.083 --> 00:10:00.125
you are no longer trapped by the surface.

175
00:10:00.125 --> 00:10:05.166
Then your effort gives not only gain –

176
00:10:05.166 --> 00:10:08.375
but also the light of knowledge.

177
00:10:08.375 --> 00:10:09.583
Reflect on this.
